@startuml
title ecst-go: компоненты и потоки

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "Ваш сервис: запись" as Write {
  [Бизнес-логика] as Biz
  database "БД сервиса\n+ outbox-таблица" as DB
}

package "ecst.Service — Outbox" as Out {
  [outboxWorker] as OW
  [producer.Producer\nпубликация] as P1
}

cloud "Kafka" as K {
  queue "orders" as T1
  queue "users" as T2
  queue "users.dlq" as D1
}

package "ecst.Service — Inbox" as In {
  [пул consumer.Consumer\nна топик] as C
  [producer.Producer\nDLQ] as P2
}

package "Ваш сервис: применение" as Apply {
  [Handler] as H
  database "БД-копия\nчужих сущностей" as Read
}

Biz    --> DB : одна транзакция:\nUPDATE + INSERT outbox
DB     --> OW : Fetch\n(FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
OW     --> DB : MarkSent / MarkFailed
OW     --> P1
P1     --> T1 : ProduceSyncResults\nkey = entity_id

T2     --> C  : PollRecords
C      --> H  : envelope.Envelope[T]\n(декод в ecst.Topic)
H      --> Read : условный upsert\nпо version
C      --> P2 : запись не пристроена
P2     --> D1 : ProduceSync\n+ dlq_* headers

note right of Out
  У Outbox и Inbox свои продюсеры:
  поток публикации не должен занимать
  буфер, из которого пишется DLQ
end note

note right of Apply
  Handler обязан быть идемпотентным:
  at-least-once в обе стороны
end note
@enduml
